            "diagnosis_primary.0"
          ],
          "text": "Thank you for your ongoing care of this 9-year-old female who was admitted on 17/05 with a 2-week history of polyuria and polydipsia, 3 kg weight loss, 2 days of vomiting and abdominal pain, and drowsiness, and was diagnosed with diabetic ketoacidosis (DKA) as a new presentation of type 1 diabetes mellitus.",
